From fb76962b7f1fb39f0dcb67468ec716e4cf59fb69 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 09:54:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(session status): reconcile acknowledged subagent losses
 and checkpoint shutdown [daveey]

Reconcile acknowledged subagent losses and checkpoint detached children during
backend shutdown. Retained failures previously required a successful successor
with no linked work, leaving orchestration chats unable to clear consumed losses.

Record owner-qualified consumption receipts with completion delivery, revoke
them on reopened admission, retain them through ledger pruning and reconcile
late completed transcripts. Add sessions outcome --ack-subagent --evidence for
independently verified historical losses. Preserve genuine unacknowledged loss
and explicit person-stop precedence; checkpoint settled results before cleanup.

